                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "***DO NOT BUY***\nThe Bioshock games are masterpieces. And the Bioshock Collection, which includes Bioshock 2, would be a no-brainer, except for the fact that the stability is absolute trash. THESE GAMES CRASH CONSTANTLY, kicking you back to your last save/autosave. For a collection of 15-20 year old games, this is flat-out unacceptable. And it isn't a Steam Deck issue either, as the exact same thing happens with the Switch version.\nShame on 2K for this shoddy POS \"remaster\" that runs worse than the original titles. \n",
